			"id":"dc185930993b35ef",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Info\n\nMom of [[Simon P Jones.canvas|Simon P Jones]].\nMarried to [[Daniel Jones.canvas|Daniel Jones]].\nCousin of [[Courtney.canvas|Courtney]].\nWriter that used the penname [[Marion Marigold.canvas|Marion Marigold]].\n\nWrote many books that could be considered subversive to the current government.\nDisappeared four years ago or more.\nProbably disappeared around February according to [[Courtney.canvas|Courtney]] letter on the [[Shelter.canvas|Shelter]] TIme-safe Lock.\n\nFebruary 22nd of 87 was the date on a journal note about her disappearance.\nCourtney says that she was smuggled through the southern seafront around seven months after the disappearance, in other words, in september.\n\nApparently, on the same date, the [[Ruby Crown.canvas|Ruby Crown]] jewels were stolen.\n[[Black Water.canvas|Black Water]] insurgents may be involved.\n[[RLCF.canvas|RLCF]] seems relevant?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-360,
